      "date": "2026-02-14T21:25:37.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹2.13 (vs ₹1.61 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.13 (up from ₹1.61 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹4.08b (up 96% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹80.6m (up 106% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.0% (up from 1.9% in 3Q 2025). Revenue is forecast to grow 12% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 9.9% growth forecast for the Food industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 106 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
